# ---- merge-queue reconciler (hub only, optional, BH-5670) ----
# bin/merge-queue-reconcile.sh (cron */2, hub) reads Mergify's
# merge-queue/status for each repo with an active queue row and corrects a
# stage row a dropped webhook left wrong. Unset = the lane logs not-configured
# and sends nothing. A Mergify application key with read access to the merge
# queue. It is a different key from MERGIFY_CI_KEY. Set it on the hub only.
#MERGIFY_API_TOKEN=
